Package: wiki.qaq.apelin.agent-tools.disassembler
Name: Apelin Disassembler
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Disassembly and Mach-O symbol tools for Apelin's agent, for @FLAVOR@ jailbreaks
 An agent tool extension for Apelin. It gives the agent two read-only tools: disassemble, which decodes instructions from a Mach-O binary with Capstone, and symbols, which lists a binary's symbol table. It runs as its own process and only when Apelin's agent calls it.
